Interference over 2NT: over a double, Stayman and transfers stay on (as over
1NT) and a redouble shows slam interest; over an overcall, with game values
(4+ hcp) responder bids 3NT with a stopper or doubles; otherwise passes. After
a completed transfer, a further overcall is doubled with game values.

